  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UGANDA  Support for the Uganda Petroleum Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support UPIK in achieving its long-term mission to develop workforce capacity for the oil industry.  The specific objectives of the proposed grant activites are to: 1.   Provide a basic support package to UPIK to enable it to fund its immediate short term needs in the areas of furnishings and equipmentcomma instructor trainingcomma teaching materialscomma and curriculum development. 2.   Prepare a national oil sector capacity building plan to give the government guidance in managing all of its oil-related training and education programs and to establish the necessary context into which the mission of UPIKcomma the TVET schoolscomma and other institutions can fit. 3.   Assist UPIK in attracting additional short- and long-term financing from donorscomma industry and the government</narrative>
  </description>
